{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1432949-aberrant-questions-about-skill-trick-and-defense","id":1432949,"title":"[Aberrant] Questions about Skill Trick and Defense.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-21T13:32:23-08:00","id":1432949,"title":"[Aberrant] Questions about Skill Trick and Defense.","content":"<span style=\"color:#1D2228\"><span style=\"font-family:YahooSans\"> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"> Question about Defense in Aberrant. I\u2019m working with a player to build his PC for a game I\u2019m running he has created a new skill trick.<br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Evading dash. \u2013 Athletics add to defense when attempting evade an attack. He says that since a Skill trick can add dice to roll under specific circumstances that adding 4 (his athletics) to is defense is correct.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">I\u2019m not sure because defense states \u201c</span>A character\u2019s standard Defense is 1 which sets the Difficulty of the attacker\u2019s roll. A character can defend to increase the Difficulty an attack must overcome to success\u00adfully hit its target. The player may roll the most appropriate Reslience Attribute without any Skills and use successes on this roll to purchase Defensive Stunts.\u201d<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">\u201cA Skill Trick can <b>add dice to a roll </b>under specif\u00adic circumstances. The number of dice added will usually be equal to the Skill that the Trick is as\u00adsociated with.\u201d</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">I just want to know If it\u2019s a correct way to use a Skill trick considering the defense roll mentions with out skills in it\u2019s description. </span><br /> <br /> </span><br /> <br /> <br /> </span><br /> <br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2228\"><span style=\"font-family:YahooSans\"> <br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26393-shadowknyght","name":"shadowknyght","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-21T13:45:01-08:00","id":1432951,"title":"","content":"For certain, it should cost a momentum to use. I would then add the Athletics dice to the Resilience dice for the character's defense roll that round.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-21T13:53:18-08:00","id":1432955,"title":"","content":"I agree with Florin, that is exaclty how I'd run that at my table. I think letting it add directly to the base defense is too powerful for a skill trick, because it is too certain. This looks a lot like the Integrity skill trick Meditative Stance which costs a Momentum and adds a character's Intergrity dots as dice to the reflective Resilience roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-21T15:13:45-08:00","id":1432968,"title":"","content":"Spend Momentum and add *dice*, yes. Not auto successes. Adding Athletics of 4 should on average net 1 extra success for defense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}